    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;be a quadrilateral. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> are the mid points of the diagonals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math> respectively and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to",
